  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tPayroll\n\t\tPayroll Help Guide\n\n### Zero FPS (Zero Payroll)\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Fri, 4 Nov, 2022 at 12:14 AM\n\n\t\tLocation: Payroll > Client Specific > Manage Payroll > Process Payroll > Payroll\n\n After you have navigated your way to the payroll, select 'Run Payroll'.\n\nSelect 'Run Payroll' and the following will appear. \n\nTick the 'Zero Payslip' checkbox.\n\nOnce ticked, select next to display the 'Payroll Details' which will show no figures. \n\nOnce you are happy with the figures, select finish to complete the payroll. \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115223\">Payroll</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188533\">Payroll Help Guide</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Zero FPS (Zero Payroll)\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Fri, 4 Nov, 2022 at 12:14 AM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Location:&nbsp;</strong>Payroll &gt; Client Specific &gt; Manage Payroll &gt; Process Payroll &gt; Payroll</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9169554698/original/6zjeD5k6GFHPBVfpb85_86MhEolTpQadEg.png?1664459576\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"9169554698\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; vertical-align: top; max-width: 100%; position: relative; cursor: pointer; padding: 0px 1px; margin: 5px auto 5px 0px; display: block; float: none; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</strong>After you have navigated your way to the payroll, select 'Run Payroll'.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9169554792/original/yaif2RS89lnp0R_6C52g6vHO56P7CKRG7Q.png?1664459609\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9169554792\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Select 'Run Payroll' and the following will appear.&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9169554447/original/UMMKrkIAbyu1mt2s6nnZbmrpyed1FRqOHg.png?1664459464\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9169554447\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Tick the 'Zero Payslip' checkbox.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9169553129/original/3z4K0vosyP7JxSf5w2Mr19EAltH1_1KJNw.png?1664458824\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9169553129\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Once ticked, select next to display the 'Payroll Details' which will show no figures.&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9169554076/original/rtBuOko6CHQEFiK08ekRs6jub7o-3Fp-SQ.png?1664459306\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9169554076\"></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Once you are happy with the figures, select finish to complete the payroll.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000219820\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">